            </div>
            <p class="text-tc-muted text-xs leading-relaxed">
              Penulis konten edukasi karier digital dan panduan persiapan PKL SMK RPL di Gemilang Training Malang.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- CTA PROMO WHATSAPP -->
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-tc-bg to-tc-card border border-tc-accent/50 rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 text-center space-y-4 shadow-2xl">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Pastikan Syarat & Jadwal PKL RPL di Gemilang Training</h3>
          <p class="text-tc-muted text-xs md:text-sm max-w-lg mx-auto">
            Konfirmasi kelengkapan dokumen sekolah, kuota jalur RPL, dan sistem pelaksanaan PKL bersama admin sebelum mengajukan berkas.
          </p>
          <a 
            href="https://wa.me/6281943431484?text=Halo%20Admin%20Gemilang%20Training%2C%20saya%20ingin%20memastikan%20syarat%20dan%20jadwal%20PKL%20RPL." 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer" 
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-tc-accent hover:bg-tc-accentHover text-slate-950 font-bold px-6 py-3 rounded-xl transition-all shadow-lg text-xs md:text-sm"
          >
            <span>Cek Syarat PKL via WA</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- FAQ ACCORDION SECTION -->
        <section id="faq-section" class="border-t border-tc-border pt-8 space-y-4">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">FAQ Persiapan PKL RPL</h3>
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <details class="bg-tc-bg p-4 rounded-xl border border-tc-border group cursor-pointer">
              <summary class="text-xs md:text-sm font-semibold text-white flex justify-between items-center list-none select-none">
                <span>Apakah siswa RPL harus mahir ngoding sebelum PKL?</span>
                <span class="text-tc-accent text-xs group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
              </summary>
              <p class="text-tc-muted text-xs mt-2 border-t border-tc-border/40 pt-2 leading-relaxed">
                Tidak harus mahir. Pemahaman dasar HTML dan CSS serta kemauan belajar sudah menjadi modal yang cukup, karena program PKL di Gemilang Training dibimbing bertahap dari dasar.
              </p>
            </details>

            <details class="bg-tc-bg p-4 rounded-xl border border-tc-border group cursor-pointer">
              <summary class="text-xs md:text-sm font-semibold text-white flex justify-between items-center list-none select-none">
                <span>Kapan waktu terbaik mulai menyiapkan berkas PKL?</span>
                <span class="text-tc-accent text-xs group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
